From bb7f5cd5e0fb07c61b0d957effd4bfa0963e3c33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:41:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(contacts): the contact page carries saved_as, as the list
 row does (4390, box 51286)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

0100 gave a list row whose label has no letter („💙") its label as
saved_as. GET /contacts/:id for the same contact still had name null and
no saved_as, so the page drew no name. The page now uses the list's own
two helpers (shownName, savedAs), exported from contactBook.service.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
